===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*pent-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|path}}, {{m|enm|peth}}, from {{inh|en|ang|pæþ||path, track}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*paþ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*paþaz||path}} (compare {{cog|fy|paad}}, {{cog|nl|pad}}, {{cog|de|Pfad}}), {{cog|grc|πατέω}} / {{m|grc|πάτος}}, from {{der|en|ira}} (compare {{cog|ae|𐬞𐬀𐬥𐬙𐬀|t=way}}, {{m|ae|𐬞𐬀𐬚𐬀|pos=genitive}}, {{cog|peo||tr=pathi-|sc=Xpeo}}), from {{der|en|ira-pro|*pántaHh}}, from {{der|en|iir-pro|*pántaHs}} (compare {{cog|sa|पन्था|tr=pánthā-}}), from {{der|en|ine-pro|*póntoh₁s}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*pent-||path}} (compare {{cog|en|find}}). {{doublet|en|panth}}.

